// 🟡 gated — feature: T-6 lexical-walk + T-7 parse-walk compiler pipeline-stage substrate (TASKS T-6/T-7) — SL-3229-T4-FORMAT-T6T7 (parse half).
// 🟡 gated — feature: T-10 emit pipeline-stage substrate (TASKS T-10) — SL-3229-T4-FORMAT-T6T7 (emit half).
// 🟡 gated — feature: unique-name profile parse enforcement binding (OpenApiUniqueNameProfileFacts consumption at parse boundary) — SL-3229-OPENAPI-UNIQUE-NAME-PARSE.
// 🟡 gated — feature: OPENAPI-NETWORK-BRIDGE consumer binding at emit boundary (openapi_http_method_bridge_catalog + openapi_response_key_wildcard_bridge_catalog) — SL-3229-OPENAPI-NETWORK-BRIDGE-EMIT.
